<div class="bpa-main bpa-first-section" >
<div class="bpa-module bpa-module-supplement bpa-white bpa-humming-bird"
id="rs_reading_area_header" >
<div class="bpa-container">
<div class="bpa-module-full-hero bpa-padded">
<header class="bpa-article-header " >
<div class="bpa-article-header-inner">
<div class="bpa-header-text">
<h2 class="bpa-topline-title-wrapper ">
<span class="bpa-topline"
>
<span class="bpa-topline-title">
Neuregelung
</span>
</span>
<br class="bpa-hide rs_pause">
<span class="bpa-title"
>
<span class="bpa-teaser-title-text">
<span class="bpa-teaser-title-text-inner">
Rechengrößen in der Sozialversicherung
</span>
</span>
</span>
</h2>
<div class="bpa-short-text" >
<p>Zum 1. Januar 2026 haben sich die Beitragsbemessungsgrenzen in der gesetzlichen Kranken- und Rentenversicherung erhöht. Grund sind die gestiegenen Löhne und Gehälter. <span>Wie sich</span><strong> </strong>die<strong> </strong>Beitragsbemessungsgrenzen<span> genau geändert haben und warum die Anpassung wichtig ist.</span></p> <div class="bpa-article-meta-infos">
<p class="bpa-article-header-date">
<span class="bpa-time" >
<time datetime="2026-04-28T22:15:00Z">
Mittwoch, 29. April 2026
</time>
</span> </p>
<p class="bpa-article-header-reading-time rs_skip">
<span class="bpa-reading-time">
<span class="bpa-reading-time__icon">
<svg viewBox="0 0 22 22"
class="bpa-icon bpa-icon-time rs_skip"
width="22"
height="22"
version="1.1"
role="img"
aria-labelledby="aria-83-91ut5bxtfda0mgv6s63nvqoco"
focusable="false"
>
<title id="aria-83-91ut5bxtfda0mgv6s63nvqoco"></title>
<use href="#icon-time"></use>
</svg>
</span>
<span class="bpa-reading-time__time">
3 Min. Lesedauer
</span>
</span>
</p> </div>
</div>
</div>
